    title: "Ukraine hits Crimean bridge ahead of meeting between Trump, Xi and Putin",
    summary: "The attack is a show of military strength as concerns grow that the gathering of the three leaders in Shenzhen could add pressure on Kyiv.",
    preview: "Ukraine struck a key bridge between mainland Russia and occupied Crimea days before Russian President Vladimir Putin is due to meet U.S. President Donald Trump and Chinese President Xi Jinping. The attack is a show of Kyiv’s military strength right as concerns are growing that the gathering of the three leaders in Shenzhen could add pressure on the war-ravaged country in peace talks with Russia. It’s also likely to delay a resumption of grain shipping in the area.",
    body: "Ukraine struck a key bridge between mainland Russia and occupied Crimea days before Russian President Vladimir Putin is due to meet U.S. President Donald Trump and Chinese President Xi Jinping.\n\nThe attack is a show of Kyiv’s military strength right as concerns are growing that the gathering of the three leaders in Shenzhen could add pressure on the war-ravaged country in peace talks with Russia. It’s also likely to delay a resumption of grain shipping in the area.\n\nOne of the arches and a span of the bridge’s road section collapsed as a result of the attack, the second in as many days, Ukraine’s General Staff said on Tuesday. The structure stretches 19 kilometers across the Kerch Strait and was a signature project for Putin after he annexed Crimea in 2014.",
