    title: "Trump’s sudden Ukraine push leaves Europe walking a tightrope",
    summary: "U.S. envoys are pressing Russian and Ukrainian officials to consider new proposals on NATO rules, military assets and troop placements across Europe.",
    preview: "The sudden U.S. push for a sweeping deal to end Russia’s war in Ukraine has Europe stuck in a bind. U.S. envoys are pressing Russian and Ukrainian officials to consider new proposals on NATO rules, military assets and troop placements across Europe as part of negotiations to end the war, according to people familiar with the matter. The U.S. has even asked Kyiv whether it would cede its Donbas region to Russia in exchange for membership in the NATO military alliance.",
    body: "The sudden U.S. push for a sweeping deal to end Russia’s war in Ukraine has Europe stuck in a bind.\n\nU.S. envoys are pressing Russian and Ukrainian officials to consider new proposals on NATO rules, military assets and troop placements across Europe as part of negotiations to end the war, according to people familiar with the matter. The U.S. has even asked Kyiv whether it would cede its Donbas region to Russia in exchange for membership in the NATO military alliance.\n\nThe prospect of blending peace talks with security talks violates a long-held tenet for Europeans: Russia’s fighting must stop first, they say, before any discussions can be held about troop movements or NATO.",
