    title: "Iran will respond ‘at the same level’ to US nuclear attack, lawmaker says",
    summary: "Iran will respond ‘at the same level’ to US nuclear attack, lawmaker says Iran will respond “at the same level” if the United States launches a nuclear attack on the country, Al Jazeera reported Mohammad Reza Mohseni Thani, a member of Iran’s National Security Commission, as saying. Mohseni Thani said there were “no positive expectations of reaching an agreement” to end the war, as diplomatic efforts to secure a settlement continue.",
    preview: "Iran will respond ‘at the same level’ to US nuclear attack, lawmaker says Iran will respond “at the same level” if the United States launches a nuclear attack on the country, Al Jazeera reported Mohammad Reza Mohseni Thani, a member of Iran’s National Security Commission, as saying. Mohseni Thani said there were “no positive expectations of reaching an agreement” to end the war, as diplomatic efforts to secure a settlement continue.",
    body: "Iran will respond ‘at the same level’ to US nuclear attack, lawmaker says Iran will respond “at the same level” if the United States launches a nuclear attack on the country, Al Jazeera reported Mohammad Reza Mohseni Thani, a member of Iran’s National Security Commission, as saying. Mohseni Thani said there were “no positive expectations of reaching an agreement” to end the war, as diplomatic efforts to secure a settlement continue.",
